## Pull request overview

This PR fixes key usability and localization issues in the calendar plugin, primarily ensuring event clicks reliably dispatch actions in the SDUI renderer and improving locale-aware rendering/visual cues in `CalendarView`.

**Changes:**
- Remove the invalid `schema.onEventClick` guard so `calendar-view-renderer` always dispatches an `event-click` action when events are clicked.
- Add locale-aware labels/weekday headers and pass `locale` into `MonthView`; improve cross-month styling, “today” spacing, and add `title` tooltips for event cards.
- Add a new test suite for the bugfix bundle and mark completed items in `ROADMAP.md`.

### Reviewed changes

Copilot reviewed 4 out of 4 changed files in this pull request and generated no comments.

| File | Description |
| ---- | ----------- |
| packages/plugin-calendar/src/calendar-view-renderer.tsx | Ensures event clicks always dispatch `onAction` (fixes dead click path in SDUI). |
| packages/plugin-calendar/src/CalendarView.tsx | Adds locale-aware labels/weekday headers, tooltips, and improved month styling/spacing. |
| packages/plugin-calendar/src/__tests__/calendar-bugfixes.test.tsx | Adds coverage for i18n/tooltips/cross-month styling and basic click behavior. |
| ROADMAP.md | Records completion of the calendar bugfix items. |


